      "1": {
        "attributes": {
          "font-size": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 19
          },
          "text": {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "INTERSECTION\nWith the intersection node you can input two shapes and use the intersection of the two shapes as a new shape. A roundness slider is provided to produce more organic shapes.\n\n- Patch Explained -\n\n• The Circle and Equilateral triangle go into the Intersection node.\n• The intersection is smooth and sent to the Shape render.\n• The Shape render converts the Shape2D to a texture."
          }
        },
